      "id": "trigger-remediation",
      "name": "Trigger Auto-Remediation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1250, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Alertmanager Webhook Receiver\n\nThis workflow receives webhooks from Alertmanager and:\n\n1. **Parses** the incoming alert payload\n2. **Extracts** alert metadata, labels, annotations\n3. **Routes** based on severity (critical/warning/info)\n4. **Forwards** to appropriate downstream workflows\n5. **Handles** both firing and resolved states\n6. **Triggers** auto-remediation for critical alerts\n\n**Webhook URL**: /webhook/alertmanager\n\n**Retry Logic**: 3 attempts with 1s backoff",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 350
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 460]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Error Handling\n\nIf downstream forwarding fails:\n- Automatic retry (3x)\n- Webhook still returns 200 OK\n- Failed alerts logged to error channel",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 300
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-2",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [850, 520]
    }
